    title: "ir.py _CALL_LINES_CAP comment claims truncation is conservative for EVERY consumer but reasons only about the walk — dropping later SOURCE lines broadens the guard (measured: 0.06% saturation, nil impact)"  # df62
    status: todo_soft  # df62
    priority: 4  # df62
